Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Worldline instantons in an \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]inflation\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] metric: the \[Beta] = 0 starting point\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.003192322518444*^9, 
  4.0031923650758247`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a73f8e72-7ab1-4b4a-9a11-\
7f75bc35a71d"],

Cell["\<\


Independent reproduction of Sec. III A\[Dash]B of P. Semr\[EAcute]n and G. \
Torgrimsson, \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Worldline instantons for nonperturbative \
particle production by space and time dependent gravitational fields\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], arXiv:2508.01901.

The pair-production probability is P ~ exp(\[Minus]\|01d49c). Its exponent \
follows from a saddle point of the worldline path integral: a geodesic in \
complex proper time u, called a worldline instanton. The complex middle part \
of the instanton describes the formation (tunnelling) region; its two ends \
become the real trajectories of the produced particle and antiparticle.

Metric (Eq. 21):  ds\.b2 = dt\.b2 \[Minus] e^{2A(t,x)} dx\.b2,  with  A = \
\[Alpha] tanh(\[Omega]t) sech\.b2(kx)  (Eq. 24).
Here \[Beta] = k/\[Omega] = 0, so the metric depends on t only. In units \
\[Omega] = 1:  A(t) = \[Alpha] tanh t.

\[Alpha] = 1 and p = 0.57 (close to the saddle-point momentum p_s) reproduce \
Fig. 2 of the paper.
The complex u-plane is covered by \[Minus]2 < Re u < 2 and \[Minus]4 < Im u < \
4.
Exact rational inputs are used so that NDSolve can work at the requested \
precision.

The instanton starts at the branch point t_B (Eq. 27). For \[Beta] = 0, Eq. \
(22) integrates once to (Eq. 25)
   \:1e8b = p e^{\[Minus]2A(t)},   \:1e6b = \[Sqrt](1 + p\.b2 \
e^{\[Minus]2A(t)}).
The middle of the instanton is the turning point \:1e6b = 0, i.e. e^{2A(t_B)} \
= \[Minus]p\.b2, which gives
   t_B = arctanh[(i\[Pi] + ln p\.b2)/(2\[Alpha])].
   \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.003191921502428*^9, 4.0031919747120686`*^9}, {
   4.0031920399633427`*^9, 4.003192065979309*^9}, 
   4.0031922913393116`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"4fe0c244-d3b7-804b-8602-\
7be8fc6d382c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"tInterp", "=", 
     RowBox[{"Import", "[", 
      RowBox[{"saveDir", "<>", "\"\<tInterp.wdx\>\""}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"alpha", "=", 
     RowBox[{"SetPrecision", "[", 
      RowBox[{"1", ",", "50"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"p", "=", 
     RowBox[{"SetPrecision", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"57", "/", "100"}], ",", "50"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Rmin", "=", 
     RowBox[{"-", "4"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Rmax", "=", "4"}], ";"}], "\n", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"urMin", "=", 
     RowBox[{"-", "2"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"urMax", "=", "2"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"xdot", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"R_", "?", "NumericQ"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"ur_", "?", "NumericQ"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"p", "*", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", "*", "alpha", " ", "*", 
        RowBox[{"Tanh", "[", 
         RowBox[{"tInterp", "[", 
          RowBox[{"R", ",", "ur"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9892274927788486`*^9, 3.9892275038228855`*^9}, 
   3.989229363255474*^9, {3.9892294008794346`*^9, 3.9892294044383545`*^9}, {
   3.9892390777548733`*^9, 3.989239079706131*^9}, {4.003191504015541*^9, 
   4.003191554933853*^9}, {4.003191872637617*^9, 4.00319191739674*^9}, {
   4.0031929021886578`*^9, 
   4.0031929032511883`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8fd770b5-ccf0-c847-9090-\
d0876ae7262c"],

Cell["\<\
Geodesic equations (Eq. 22), with dots denoting d/du:
   \:1e97 = (1 \[Minus] \:1e6b\.b2) \[PartialD]_t A,     \:1e8d = \[Minus]2 \
\:1e6b \:1e8b \[PartialD]_t A \[Minus] \:1e8b\.b2 \[PartialD]_x A.
The first form follows from \[CapitalGamma]^t_xx = \.bd \[PartialD]_t e^{2A} \
and the on-shell condition \:1e6b\.b2 \[Minus] e^{2A} \:1e8b\.b2 = 1 (Eq. 8).
For \[Beta] = 0, \[PartialD]_x A = 0.

Initial conditions at u = 0:  t = t_B,  \:1e6b = 0,  x = 0,  \:1e8b = p e^{\
\[Minus]2A(t_B)}.

The solution is first obtained along the imaginary axis u = iR (the \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]backbone\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]).
Since d/du = \[Minus]i d/dR, with T(R) = t(iR) and X(R) = x(iR):
   T\[CloseCurlyQuote]\[CloseCurlyQuote] = \[Minus](1 + T\[CloseCurlyQuote]\
\.b2) \[PartialD]_t A(T),     X\[CloseCurlyQuote]\[CloseCurlyQuote] = \
\[Minus]2 T\[CloseCurlyQuote] X\[CloseCurlyQuote] \[PartialD]_t A(T),     X\
\[CloseCurlyQuote](0) = i \:1e8b(0).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.003192102939621*^9},ExpressionUUID->"318b145d-2758-3949-a326-\
564eec5cafe3"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["solving eqn 22 ", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.989237517034004*^9, 3.989237531577486*^9}, {
  4.003192160594141*^9, 
  4.003192161555191*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c4a84aff-8271-314e-ae17-\
f434bb90079a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"A", "[", "t_", "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"alpha", "*", 
      RowBox[{"Tanh", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"At", "[", "t_", "]"}], ":=", 
     RowBox[{"alpha", "*", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sech", "[", "t", "]"}], "^", "2"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"tB", "=", 
     RowBox[{"ArcTanh", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"I", "*", "Pi"}], "+", 
         RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
          RowBox[{"p", "^", "2"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"2", "*", "alpha"}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\n", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Rstep", "=", "0.02"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"urStep", "=", "0.01"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"RGrid", "=", 
     RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Rmin", ",", "Rmax", ",", "Rstep"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"urGrid", "=", 
     RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
      RowBox[{"urMin", ",", "urMax", ",", "urStep"}], "]"}]}], 
    ";"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9892391185342464`*^9, 3.9892391267307415`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[11]:=",ExpressionUUID->"41f11034-aa35-7248-8937-6d7ac6703136"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"solBackbone", "=", 
    RowBox[{"NDSolve", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"T", "''"}], "[", "R", "]"}], "==", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"1", "+", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"T", "'"}], "[", "R", "]"}], "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"At", "[", 
           RowBox[{"T", "[", "R", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"X", "''"}], "[", "R", "]"}], "==", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"T", "'"}], "[", "R", "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"X", "'"}], "[", "R", "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"At", "[", 
           RowBox[{"T", "[", "R", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"T", "[", "0", "]"}], "==", "tB"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"T", "'"}], "[", "0", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"X", "[", "0", "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"X", "'"}], "[", "0", "]"}], "==", 
         RowBox[{"I", "*", "p", "*", 
          RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "2"}], "*", 
            RowBox[{"A", "[", "tB", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"T", ",", "X"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"R", ",", "Rmin", ",", "Rmax"}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"WorkingPrecision", "->", "50"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"AccuracyGoal", "->", "30"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"PrecisionGoal", "->", "30"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"MaxSteps", "->", "Infinity"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Tfun", "[", 
     RowBox[{"R_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"T", "[", "R", "]"}], "/.", " ", 
      RowBox[{"solBackbone", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Xfun", "[", 
     RowBox[{"R_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"X", "[", "R", "]"}], "/.", " ", 
      RowBox[{"solBackbone", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"dTfun", "[", 
     RowBox[{"R_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], ":=", 
    RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"T", "'"}], "[", "R", "]"}], "/.", " ", 
      RowBox[{"solBackbone", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"dXfun", "[", 
    RowBox[{"R_", "?", "NumericQ"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"X", "'"}], "[", "R", "]"}], "/.", " ", 
     RowBox[{"solBackbone", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.989239143758293*^9, 3.989239143758293*^9}, {
  3.9892391778640385`*^9, 3.9892391810420475`*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[18]:=",ExpressionUUID->"8e3fd61d-9342-8646-b070-1654ff1b70a1"],

